title Vinyl now playing, 480x320 (NP-480x320, owner 2026-11-13): the demonstration queue playing track 3 of 20; the format line, the output button, the volume group
sizes 480x320
ppmm 608
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing

wait 1200
shot now-playing
expect esc
expect text "Phoenix"
expect text "Fences Remixes, 2013"
expect notext "Vol 60"
expect text "60"
expect text "Evolve 65"
expect notext "Evolve 65, music quality"
expect noquit
